<title>UK: UK Peugeot vote on strike action.</title>
<headline>UK Peugeot vote on strike action.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Workers at PSA Peugeot Talbot's Coventry plant in the UK have finished voting on whether to hold strike action and are expected to back industrial action, said union leaders on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Transport and General union said the result of the vote by 3,000 workers will be announced on Wednesday. The union said it expected workers for the French car-maker to back a strike over pay and conditions ahead of a meeting between employers and union leaders on Thursday.</p>
</text>
